WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:09,250
Didn’t you already have a good conversation with Jin Song?

2
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:11,250
Why do you still look so sad?

3
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,570
Lao Jin's place should be stable.

4
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:15,570
But in two days he will be the father’s birthday

5
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:17,070
I've been busy with Lao Jin these two days.

6
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:18,570
I haven’t found a suitable birthday gift yet.

7
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:21,790
I remember that the old man seemed to like collecting antiques.

8
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:22,790
Yeah what's wrong

9
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:24,590
look at this

10
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:26,820
This was sent by Xiao Lin in the afternoon

11
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:32,400
Said to be an antique passed down from ancestors

12
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,400
How about it? Did you see something?

13
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:37,970
This is really antique nonsense

14
00:00:37,970 --> 00:00:40,970
I thought you could see something, forget it

15
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:41,970
Let's go together tomorrow
